{
  "abstract": "For the shortest superpermutation length S(n), construct covering words with asymptotic bound S(n) <= n! + (n-1)! + (n-2)! + (926683/1814400 + o(1))(n-3)!. The development proves an explicit finite bound for every n >= 14 and its numerical consequences. The coefficient is approximately 0.510738. The argument combines a finite selection, a verified connector cover, and transport to larger alphabets.",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Jay Pantone"
    }
  ],
